flowchart TD
  P["Preparation: six cards and reviewed contracts"]
  D["WP-18 #5356 merged + typed closed_out + receipt + ancestry"]
  H["Canonical handoff (read-only)"]
  C["Freeze tracked exact-revision corpus manifest"]
  R["Record identity, controls, conflicts, prompt and dispatch receipt"]
  X["Read-only external review"]
  F["Findings first: evidence | inference | author decision"]
  S["Typed internal synthesis and disposition"]
  M["Serialized publication, merge, post-merge proof, closeout"]
  W["Release WP-20 remediation"]
  B["Fail closed; no dispatch or lifecycle authority"]
  P --> D
  D -->|pass| H
  D -->|fail| B
  H --> C --> R --> X --> F --> S --> M --> W
  C -->|drift or unsafe input| B
  R -->|identity or independence ambiguity| B
  F -->|malformed or unsupported assertions| B
